  "body_html": "<p>Maréchal, ta Troupe compte par défaut une demi-douzaine de membres. Traite-la comme un suivant doté du tag <em>groupe</em> . Toutes les valeurs de départ ci-dessous peuvent changer en cours de jeu.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">La Troupe</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"HP max\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">HP max</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Armure\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Armure</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Dégâts\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Lancer les dégâts\">Dégâts</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">Les HP commencent à 6 chacun ; l'Armure à 0 ; les Dégâts à d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Tags</h3>\n<p>Ta troupe commence avec <em>groupe</em>, un tag accordé par ton passé, plus 2 autres de ton choix.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>archers</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>athlétiques</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>braves</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>rusés</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>dévoués</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Cochée d&#x27;office\"> <span><em>groupe</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>robustes</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>intimidants</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>observateurs</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>patients</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>respectés</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>furtifs</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>guerriers</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"à toi d&#x27;écrire\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"à toi d&#x27;écrire\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"à toi d&#x27;écrire\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>exceptionnels</em> (requiert Héros Jusqu'au Bout)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Instinct</h3>\n<p>Choisis-en 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>Se chamailler, se quereller et garder rancune</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>S'accrocher à la tradition et à la superstition</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>Céder à leurs plus bas instincts</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>Se donner des airs de maîtres</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>Prendre des risques inutiles</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>Aller trop loin</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"à toi d&#x27;écrire\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Prix</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Choisis-en 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Loyauté</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Loyauté 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Loyauté 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Loyauté 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Loyauté 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Loyauté 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Loyauté 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Des réjouissances, en groupe</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Reconnaissance publique et respect, honneur</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Des risques pris, par toi, pour les aider</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Des victoires remportées contre des adversaires dignes</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Des richesses gagnées pour eux-mêmes ou pour Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"à toi d&#x27;écrire\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Inventaire</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ ou moins : charge légère ; 4–6 ◇ : charge normale ; 7–9 ◇ : charge lourde.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Hachette</strong>, fer (<em>main</em>, <em>de jet</em>, x perforant)</li><li>◇ <strong>Lance</strong>, fer (<em>rapproché</em>, <em>de jet</em>, x perforant)</li><li>◇ <strong>Arc et flèches de fer</strong> (<em>proche</em>, x perforant, ○ munitions faibles, ○ épuisées)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Bouclier</strong> (+1 armure, +1 Préparation sur 7+ pour Défendre)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Peaux épaisses</strong> (1 armure, <em>chaud</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Manteau</strong> (<em>chaud</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Fournitures</strong> (4+Prospérité utilisations par membre de la troupe)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Fournitures</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Utilisation 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Utilisation 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Utilisation 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Utilisation 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Utilisation 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Utilisation 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Utilisation 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Utilisation 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Utilisation 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Utilisation 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Utilisation 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Utilisation 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Utilisation 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Utilisation 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Utilisation 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Utilisation 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Utilisation 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"Utilisation 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"Utilisation 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"Utilisation 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"Utilisation 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"Utilisation 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"Utilisation 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"Utilisation 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"Utilisation 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Autre équipement</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">Individus</h3>\n<p>Quand l'un d'eux se distingue, donne-lui un nom, un tag et un ou plusieurs traits.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nom</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nom\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traits</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traits\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nom</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nom\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traits</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traits\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nom</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nom\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traits</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traits\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nom</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nom\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traits</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traits\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nom</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nom\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traits</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traits\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nom</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nom\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traits</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traits\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Noms :</strong> Aled, Culhwich, Eira, Gerat, Glaw, Harri, Lowri, Mervyn, Nesta</p>\n<p><strong>Tags :</strong> <em>ami des bêtes, costaud, brute, cynique, ivrogne, zélé, joueur, cupide, grincheux, crédule, tombeur, honnête, gentil, grivois, petit, naïf, vieux, populaire, fier, bleu, téméraire, sans vergogne, œil perçant, soupe au lait</em></p>\n<p><strong>Traits :</strong> enfant/frère ou sœur/parent/cousin de ___, chauve, béguin pour ___, rancune contre ___, déteste ___, idolâtre ___, blagueur, désordonné, œil/doigt/main manquant(e)/___, ses enfants lui manquent, cauchemars, jeune marié, pieux, cicatrices, maigrichon, langue acérée, chante, ronfle, raconte des histoires à dormir debout, trop sérieux, ennuis à la maison, siffle, taille du bois</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notes</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notes\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">Commander les Suivants</h3>\n<p>Quand tu <strong><em>leur ordonnes de faire une manœuvre et qu'ils s'exécutent</em></strong>, lance +1 au lieu de +STAT si l'un de leurs tags s'applique (ou +2 s'ils sont en plus <em>exceptionnels</em>). Si aucun tag ne s'applique, lance +0. Si l'un de leurs tags fait obstacle, lance avec désavantage.</p>\n<p>Quand ils sont <strong><em>sans ordres</em></strong> ou qu'ils <strong><em>agissent de leur propre initiative</em></strong>, le MJ dit ce qu'ils font et comment ça se passe.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">Renforcer votre lien</h3>\n<p>Quand tu <strong><em>paies leur prix</em></strong> et que tu ne l'as pas fait récemment, ils gardent +1 Loyauté (max 3).</p>\n<p>Dépense leur Loyauté à raison de 1 pour 1 pour qu'ils :</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Surmontent leur peur et fassent ce que tu dis</li><li>Se retiennent d'agir selon leur instinct/tags/traits</li><li>Fassent quelque chose qu'ils ne veulent pas faire (tant que ce n'est ni odieux ni suicidaire)</li></ul>"
}
